@startuml
actor Automation as A
participant CLI
participant discover_commands
participant validate_module as Validate
participant storage as Storage
participant transitions as Transitions

A -> CLI: sirius validate-workflow-state
CLI -> discover_commands: discover_commands()
discover_commands --> CLI: CommandSpec list
CLI -> Validate: load module & call main()
Validate -> Storage: read state files
Validate -> Transitions: run transition checks
Validate --> CLI: exit code / report
CLI --> A: return status and report
@enduml
